  "description": "NetExt.Strings is a powerful utility library that extends string manipulation capabilities in .NET. It provides a variety of robust, easy-to-use methods for trimming, validating, transforming, encoding, and replacing string values. This package simplifies common string operations, improves code readability, and enhances productivity for .NET developers.",
