  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0: Migrate to new namespace and package name\n      v1.0.5: Fix typo in `IsNotNullOrEmptyOrWhiteSpaceExt` -> `IsNullOrEmptyOrWhiteSpaceExt` \n      v1.0.4: Remove `TrimExt` extension due to low usage, remove obsolete `IsNullOrVoidExt` extension. Split `IsEmptyExt` extension to `IsNullOrEmptyExt`, `IsNullOrWhiteSpaceExt`, `IsNotNullOrEmptyOrWhiteSpaceExt`\n      v1.0.3: Add .NET 10 support\n      v1.0.2: add IsEmpty extension, as replacment for\n      v1.0.1: the final version after split\n      v1.0.0: migrate to separate nuget package from NetExt.Core",
